# Биллинг (РФ)

- **BillingProvider** interface in Go; implementations Robokassa, YooKassa.
- Same subscription service for UI, webhooks, entitlements.
- Webhooks: `/app/api/v1/webhooks/...`; signature verify; idempotent.
- WP Result URL pattern (Erman): WP may OK unknown InvId; app webhooks separate.
- Server-side quota enforcement (channels, posts, AI credits).
- Amounts in ₽; legal links to WordPress pages.
- Tests: checkout, webhook replay, quota block, plan change.
